  "body": "Edith Hopper Park out the back gate, Big Manly Beach down the road and a super cute, beautifully kept three-bedroom home ready to enjoy - 42 Ladies Mile gets the lifestyle equation right. Picture the kids popping out the back gate to the playground, afternoons on the beach and weekends spent swimming, paddleboarding and catching up with friends. This is the kind of home where childhood memories are made. Tucked away down a tree-lined driveway, this fully fenced, easy-care home offers a fantastic opportunity for young families, first-home buyers or those wanting a low-maintenance slice of Manly.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Charming, beautifully presented three-bedroom home\r\n* Fully fenced section, ideal for children and pets\r\n* Private back deck and lawn for relaxing and entertaining\r\n* Gated access straight into Edith Hopper Park, with playground, sports fields and courts\r\n* Double garage plus additional carport\r\n* Just 200 metres to Whangaparaoa Primary School\r\n* Walking distance to local early childhood centres\r\n* Only 650 metres to Big Manly Beach\r\n* Handy to Coast Plaza Shopping Centre\r\n\r\nFrom morning beach swims and coffee at the local cafes to school runs and after-school adventures at the park, everything that makes Manly such a popular place to live is close at hand. It's a brilliant spot to raise a family, enjoy the outdoors and make the most of everything the Whangaparaoa Peninsula has to offer.\r\n\r\nCute, coastal and incredibly well positioned, this is one you'll want to see. Get in touch today to arrange your viewing!\r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday 10th December from 3:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/5EQ2\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
